==Battleground==
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s (400%) spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

